    "physicalNotes": [
      "Connect the 1N5819 cathode stripe to VCC. Insulate the TO-220 pigtails and keep the metal drain tab isolated.",
      "Drive the gate actively at either 0 V or 5 V. Connect the gate reference and 12 V supply return together before energizing.",
      "The 390 Ω resistor keeps even the zero winding-resistance ideal current below the inductor rating."
    ]
